{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "CloseX"}, "description": {"en-US": "Apps from CloseX: ThinkTerm for Android, updated with every ThinkTerm release."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "260a34a00162490c675730ec68e786a1a8491f01e24e3e545b71b26136231756", "size": 128878}}, "address": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RoversX/fdroid/dist/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1795263492000, "categories": {"System": {"name": {"en-US": "System"}}}}, "packages": {"com.roversx.thinkterm": {"metadata": {"added": 1794816100000, "categories": ["System"], "changelog": "https://github.com/RoversX/ThinkTerm/releases", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/RoversX/ThinkTerm/issues", "lastUpdated": 1795263492000, "license": "GPL-3.0-only", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/RoversX/ThinkTerm", "webSite": "https://closex.org/thinkterm", "name": {"en-US": "ThinkTerm"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Pick up your ThinkTerm terminals from your phone"}, "description": {"en-US": "ThinkTerm for Android opens the terminals you run in ThinkTerm on your\ncomputers and servers. The programs keep running there; the phone picks\nup the same threads and panes you left on the desktop.\n\n* Every thread on every host on one home screen, each with a live preview\n* Switch panes, see how they are split, zoom one to the whole screen\n* A key bar with Esc, Tab, Ctrl, arrows and more, over any keyboard\n* Send photos, files and clipboard images into a session\n* Connect over SSH, or through Tailscale built into the app\n* Follows the system's light or dark mode, in your terminal's colors\n\nKeep the app and ThinkTerm on your hosts on the same release: each\nrelease of the app talks to the ThinkTerm of the same version."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.roversx.thinkterm/en-US/icon_PFTW2bUzgVuer0hYM9vrJzKwrMVtJERBOvNrI8zY-1s=.png", "sha256": "3c54d6d9b533815b9eaf485833dbeb2732b0acc56d2444413af36b23ccd8fb5b", "size": 95959}}, "preferredSigner": "4b4f9a600475356e4f8ab9c45645492ad4a482d2866059f8b9719e28833cb7